# Power BI Portfolio

Practice projects built while working through a Power BI Desktop course
([video link](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e6QD8lP-m6E)). I recreated each project
hands-on in Power BI Desktop and documented what I learned.

## Projects

| Project | What it covers |
|---|---|
| [01 – Superstore Data Modeling](./01-superstore-data-modeling) | Importing data from Excel, Access, and web sources; Power Query cleaning; star-schema modeling; DAX |
| [02 – Retail Analysis Report](./02-retail-analysis-report) | Multi-page report with slicers, drill-through, bookmarks, conditional formatting, accessibility |
| [03 – Sales & Marketing Analytics](./03-sales-marketing-analytics) | Grouping, binning, drill down/up, key influencers, forecasting, animated scatter chart |

## Skills practised
Power BI Desktop · Power Query · DAX · Data Modeling · Data Visualization · Report Accessibility

## Scope
All work was done in Power BI Desktop
## Data sources
Sample datasets from the course and Microsoft's Power BI samples. Data files are not
re-uploaded; see each project folder for source links.
